      <data key="d7">9606</data>
      <data key="d8">RNASEH2A</data>
      <data key="d9">Ribonuclease H2 subunit A; Catalytic subunit of RNase HII, an endonuclease that specifically degrades the RNA of RNA:DNA hybrids. Participates in DNA replication, possibly by mediating the removal of lagging-strand Okazaki fragment RNA primers during DNA replication. Mediates the excision of single ribonucleotides from DNA:RNA duplexes. Belongs to the RNase HII family. Eukaryotic subfamily.</data>
