      <data key="d9">Deubiquitinating protein VCIP135; Acts as a deubiquitinating enzyme. Necessary for VCP-mediated reassembly of Golgi stacks after mitosis. May play a role in VCP- mediated formation of transitional endoplasmic reticulum (tER). Mediates dissociation of the ternary complex containing STX5A, NSFL1C and VCP (By similarity). Hydrolyzes 'Lys-11'- and 'Lys-48'-linked polyubiquitin chains.</data>
